85: 
86: The original +6.359% point estimate is now accompanied by a 30-date distribution: **mean +5.888%, 95% CI [+5.235%, +6.540%]**, with the full-span and single-month panels reported separately above. The result supports catalogue-specific coordination headroom beyond one exact unilateral path; it does not establish a global coordination ceiling.

