The guard is a concrete weakness: it protects a count relative to BASELINE, not the committed policy’s served users or their delivered rates. A fixed assignment can therefore still permit gains from causing outages or reducing service. The PA model also makes the general optimization nonconvex, although fixed feasible modes may admit a much simpler minimum-power solve.
